# Evidata API — Requests para VS Code REST Client
# Instalar extensión: REST Client (Huachao Mao)
#
# Variables: ajustar según ambiente local
# Stack local: start.sh → API en http://localhost:5000

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@tenantId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@adminId  = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010
@userId   = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011

# Headers de autenticación local (DEV ONLY)
# ⚠️ Solo funcionan en ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Development

###
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
# HEALTH
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### Health Check — estado general
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Health Check — detalle de cada dependencia
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/detail

### OpenAPI Schema
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

###
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
# TENANT MANAGEMENT
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### Obtener tenant seed
# @name getTenant
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-User: {{adminId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Tenant: {{tenantId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Email: admin@localdev.evidata

### Crear nuevo tenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants
Content-Type: application/json
X-Evidata-Dev-User: {{adminId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Tenant: {{tenantId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Email: admin@localdev.evidata

{
  "slug": "nueva-empresa",
  "name": "Nueva Empresa SpA"
}

### Actualizar configuración del tenant
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/settings
Content-Type: application/json
X-Evidata-Dev-User: {{adminId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Tenant: {{tenantId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Email: admin@localdev.evidata

{
  "timeZone": "America/Santiago",
  "locale": "es-CL",
  "maxUsers": 50,
  "mfaRequired": false
}

### Cambiar estado del tenant
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-Evidata-Dev-User: {{adminId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Tenant: {{tenantId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Email: admin@localdev.evidata

{
  "status": "Active"
}

###
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
# IDENTITY / PERFILES
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### Obtener perfil del usuario admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/profile
X-Evidata-Dev-User: {{adminId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Tenant: {{tenantId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Email: admin@localdev.evidata

### Obtener perfil del usuario regular
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/profile
X-Evidata-Dev-User: {{userId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Tenant: {{tenantId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Email: user@localdev.evidata

### Vincular identidad externa (ejemplo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/link
Content-Type: application/json
X-Evidata-Dev-User: {{adminId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Tenant: {{tenantId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Email: admin@localdev.evidata

{
  "externalProvider": "AzureAD",
  "externalId": "azure-object-id-12345",
  "email": "admin@empresa.com",
  "displayName": "Administrador Principal"
}

###
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
# SECURITY / RBAC
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### Ver roles del admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/users/{{adminId}}?tenantId={{tenantId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-User: {{adminId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Tenant: {{tenantId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Email: admin@localdev.evidata

### Ver roles del usuario regular
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/users/{{userId}}?tenantId={{tenantId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-User: {{adminId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Tenant: {{tenantId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Email: admin@localdev.evidata

### Asignar rol DPO al admin (idempotente)
# @name assignRole
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/assign
Content-Type: application/json
X-Evidata-Dev-User: {{adminId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Tenant: {{tenantId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Email: admin@localdev.evidata

{
  "userId": "{{adminId}}",
  "roleId": "b0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "tenantId": "{{tenantId}}"
}

### Asignar rol PrivacyAnalyst al usuario regular
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/assign
Content-Type: application/json
X-Evidata-Dev-User: {{adminId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Tenant: {{tenantId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Email: admin@localdev.evidata

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "roleId": "b0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "tenantId": "{{tenantId}}"
}

###
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
# AUDIT
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### Ver log de auditoría del tenant
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit?tenantId={{tenantId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-User: {{adminId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Tenant: {{tenantId}}
X-Evidata-Dev-Email: admin@localdev.evidata
